    "norm": "Tests {@link InternationalFixedDate#getLong(TemporalField)}. <p>The International Fixed calendar has 13 months of 28 days each. Two extra days fall outside the normal weekly cycle and are reported with field value {@code 0}: <ul> <li>\"Year Day\" is the 29th day of month 13 (always present).</li> <li>\"Leap Day\" is the 29th day of month 6 (present only in leap years, e.g. 2012).</li> </ul>"
